WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,960
Mo Mo, mom has to go downstairs to do some errands.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,160
You just play here

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:08,140
If something happens, just call mom, mom.

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,320
Yes, that's it

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:15,920
Now I feel at ease

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,920
They are all the latest models, which are pretty good.

7
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:23,030
This is convenient

8
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:32,610
Very good. This RV is spacious enough.

9
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:33,810
Still a bit mixed

10
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:35,610
The roof also has its own solar system

11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,610
This is the real RV of the last days

12
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,020
This can be used as an arrest car

13
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:49,290
These two off-road vehicles receive more traffic than my current one.

14
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:54,850
The furniture really needs to be dealt with quickly.

15
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:55,850
Keep hoarding like this

16
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:57,050
There's no place to park the car
